    "excerpt": "<p>Biweekly Programming Assignments are Programming assignments that will be conducted every two weeks.</p>\n<p>Schedule:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"164091\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/2/58956e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"quote-title__text-content\">\n      <a href=\"https://discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/t/bpts-release-dates-for-jan-2025-term/164091\">BPT's Release Dates for Jan 2025 Term</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/courses/sc-kb/36\"><span data-category-id=\"36\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #0088CC; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"9\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square --has-parent\" title=\"This category is created to address subject-specific queries related to System Commands\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">System Commands</span></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    BPT-1 End of 2nd Week: 24th Jan 2025 @ 19:00 IST.\nBPT-2 End of 4th Week: 7th Feb 2025 @ 19:00 IST.\nBPT-3 End of 6th Week: 21st Feb 2025 @ 19:00 IST.\nBPT-4 End of 9th Week: 14th March 2025 @ 19:00 IST.\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
